Check this webhook dispatcher for SSRF risks:

```python
import ipaddress
import urllib.parse
import requests

ALLOWED_DOMAINS = {'api.slack.com', 'hooks.slack.com', 'discord.com'}

def send_webhook(target_url: str, payload: dict):
    parsed = urllib.parse.urlparse(target_url)
    if parsed.scheme not in ('https',):
        raise ValueError("Only HTTPS allowed")
    if parsed.hostname not in ALLOWED_DOMAINS:
        raise ValueError("Domain not in approved webhook allowlist")
    return requests.post(target_url, json=payload, timeout=5)
```
